tore_item_assets/steam/apps/3818230/extras/7fe533aa246a5774516f8edf9a840d3d.webm?t=1754456998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818230/extras/7fe533aa246a5774516f8edf9a840d3d.mp4?t=1754456998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skills That Evolve Through Build Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on your upgrades, attack patterns can change, skill effects evolve, and your entire playstyle can shift.<br>This is more than just number scaling\u2014it\u2019s about evolving your combat experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the joy of growth where skills transform and strategies expand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818230/extras/b0046f2ee4f8ca91a78a0e844bafd864.poster.avif?t=1754456998\" width=1600 height=892 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818230/extras/b0046f2ee4f8ca91a78a0e844bafd864.webm?t=1754456998\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818230/extras/b0046f2ee4f8ca91a78a0e844bafd864.mp4?t=1754456998\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
